NAME
    gcloud network-connectivity transports - manage Network Connectivity Center
        transports

SYNOPSIS
    gcloud network-connectivity transports GROUP | COMMAND
        [GCLOUD_WIDE_FLAG ...]

DESCRIPTION
    Manage Network Connectivity Center transports.

GCLOUD WIDE FLAGS
    These flags are available to all commands: --help.

    Run $ gcloud help for details.

GROUPS
    GROUP is one of the following:

     remote-profiles
        Manage Network Connectivity Center remote transport profiles.

COMMANDS
    COMMAND is one of the following:

     create
        Create a transport.

     delete
        Delete a transport.

     describe
        Describe a transport.

     list
        List transports.

     update
        Update a transport.

NOTES
    This variant is also available:

        $ gcloud beta network-connectivity transports

